-| **Hephaestus** | gpt-5.4 medium | 0.1 | all | — | Autonomous deep worker |
-| **Oracle** | gpt-5.4 high | 0.1 | subagent | gemini-3.1-pro high -> claude-opus-4-7 max | Read-only consultation |
